      "instance_name": "formal_hearing",
      "label": "formal_hearing",
      "description": "A formal hearing scene featuring a man in the foreground speaking into a microphone, with other individuals seated in the background, suggesting a formal proceeding such as a congressional hearing. The text overlays imply a humorous or satirical context.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
